### ============================
### 🛒 PRODUCT
### ============================

### GET all products
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product

### GET product by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product/0c886c16-939b-4897-9128-3bcc151a8d06

### CREATE new product
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nasi Goreng Kambing",
  "price": 25000,
  "description": "Porsi jumbo + telur",
  "category": "makanan",
  "image_uri": "http://localhost:9990/image/nasi-goreng.jpg",
  "is_active": true,
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE product
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product/:productId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nasi Goreng Spesial",
  "price": 28000,
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE product
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product/:productId

---

### ============================
### 🧩 ADD-ON GROUP
### ============================

### GET all add-on groups
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon-group

### GET add-on group by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon-group/:groupId

### CREATE add-on group
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon-group
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "0c886c16-939b-4897-9128-3bcc151a8d06",
  "name": "Topping Wajib",
  "is_required": true,
  "max_selection": 2,
  "is_active": true,
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE add-on group
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon-group/:groupId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Topping Wajib (updated)",
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE add-on group (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon-group/:groupId

---

### ============================
### 🧂 ADD-ON
### ============================

### GET all add-ons
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon

### GET add-on by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon/bb2ec747-7c8f-441e-b647-9860d7d09bd9

### CREATE add-on
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "add_on_group_id": "79199bae-64b5-4f7f-92fe-9880c5822bf0",
  "name": "Keju",
  "price": 5000,
  "is_active": true,
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE add-on
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon/:addonId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keju (updated)",
  "price": 6000,
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE add-on (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/addon/:addonId

