### ============================
### ⚙️ PRODUCT CONFIG
### ============================

### GET all product config
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product-config

### GET product config by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product-config/:configId

### CREATE product config
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product-config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "fd593ce6-e9c2-4ce6-a73a-b781ecea8261",
  "inventory_id": "6c5d1151-aa4a-401c-83aa-f43d20705ee9",
  "operation": "minus",
  "value": 5,
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE product config
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product-config/3c2e23f9-ac33-4cff-ab51-1fbc91870ee3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 5,
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE product config
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/product/product-config/:configId

